  "post_content": "<p>El Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este jueves un cuentacuentos, a cargo de Felip Kervarek, de M&oacute;n d&#39;Animaci&oacute;, que ha explicado historias de los hermanos Grimm ante numeros&iacute;simo p&uacute;blico infantil y acompa&ntilde;antes.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_5008.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Han asistido la reina infantil de la Fira, Claudia Ramos Gil, sus damitas, Nayara P&eacute;rez Monferrer y Nut Gil Miravet, y sus acompa&ntilde;antes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5007.jpg\" alt=\"img_5007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5008.jpg\" alt=\"img_5008\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5010.jpg\" alt=\"img_5010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5011.jpg\" alt=\"img_5011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5012.jpg\" alt=\"img_5012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5013.jpg\" alt=\"img_5013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5014.jpg\" alt=\"img_5014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5015.jpg\" alt=\"img_5015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5016.jpg\" alt=\"img_5016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5017.jpg\" alt=\"img_5017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5018.jpg\" alt=\"img_5018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5019.jpg\" alt=\"img_5019\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5020.jpg\" alt=\"img_5020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5021.jpg\" alt=\"img_5021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/contacontesfelipkervarekateneuonda/img_5022.jpg\" alt=\"img_5022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
